  "title": "CEA Gauges Industry Readiness for Innovations in Transmission Technologies",
  "summary": "The Central Electricity Authority (CEA) has sought details from manufacturers on their readiness to develop innovative transmission technologies to address right-of-way (RoW) challenges in India's power transmission infrastructure. The CEA request is in the context of the Ministry of Power considering mandating the use of technological innovations in pole structures, multi-circuit configurations, and insulated cross arms, in suitable corridors for upcoming interstate transmission system (ISTS) projects.",
